        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on the pilgrimage to the sacred spring of Karatl. Experience an initiatory quest as you meet the wandering souls who haunt this desolate road. Drink from the cup of the red fountain and witness the revelation of your own soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975930/extras/8c1130aa10a06f9f807b7aeb341fe3e7.avif?t=1759817711\" width=1560 height=229 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short pilgrimage of 15-20 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, unique path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple-choice dialogues that will change your understanding of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A randomly generated final sequence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975930/extras/2558980bb37a2d0d2f227d222f26b40d.avif?t=1759817711\" width=1560 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Road to Karatl</i> is our very first game, and we sincerely hope you will enjoy this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Wild Angels Games, and this project is our very first step into the world of video games. Through <i>Road to Karatl</i>, we hope to receive enough support to continue on this path and create other projects in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish you a meaningful journey to the ancient city of Karatl.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on the pilgrimage to the sacred spring of Karatl. Experience an initiatory quest as you meet the wandering souls who haunt this desolate road. Drink from the cup of the red fountain and witness the revelation of your own soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975930/extras/8c1130aa10a06f9f807b7aeb341fe3e7.avif?t=1759817711\" width=1560 height=229 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short pilgrimage of 15-20 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, unique path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple-choice dialogues that will change your understanding of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A randomly generated final sequence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975930/extras/2558980bb37a2d0d2f227d222f26b40d.avif?t=1759817711\" width=1560 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Road to Karatl</i> is our very first game, and we sincerely hope you will enjoy this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Wild Angels Games, and this project is our very first step into the world of video games. Through <i>Road to Karatl</i>, we hope to receive enough support to continue on this path and create other projects in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish you a meaningful journey to the ancient city of Karatl.</p>",
